{"ID":"20240513083316-2si607b","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240513083316-2si607b","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513083316-2si607b\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513113844-rk61xrt\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513113844-rk61xrt\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:624,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513113844-rk61xrt\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:525,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:525\u0026#125;","title":"094","type":"doc","updated":"20240515125506"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240513113844-rk61xrt","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 721px;","id":"20240513113844-rk61xrt","updated":"20240515125506"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期："}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"079-1 L, E"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"女"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1942年出生"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2008/3/6"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"呼吸不順，早上起床時覺得胸口很多東西咳不出來，躺下時暈眩，無法向右睡，只能靠左側躺"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"→"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"甘遂半夏湯"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"證病人2007/3/20日初診，西醫確診為肺癌第四期，預估活不過半年，老師看診後持續服藥至今，因為藥吃光了回診。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診：\n1、胃口："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"好。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2、生理期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"停經25年。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"3、睡眠："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"睡尚好，2:00AM醒。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"4、大便："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"每日5~6次"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→紫參湯證。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"5、小便："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"順，色中黃。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"6、手足溫度："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"腳熱。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"夏脈"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→春季為肝之王時，脈應為弦，若出現夏脈為順為吉。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診：\n1、舌診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白乾"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2、眼診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"腎區正常，脾區正常，肝區環紋為脂肪肝，心區正常，肺區有黃斑為痰積肺中。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肺中熱，陰實在肺，陽不入陰。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"甘遂半夏湯10粒   加兩匙蜂蜜和水沖服"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"紫參四錢 甘草四錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→紫參甘草湯，專治肺癌胸痛下痢"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"半夏四錢 南星三錢 桔梗一兩 生薑二片"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→止嘔，去痰，去水"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"柴胡三錢 玉金五錢 青皮二錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→治肺要先治肝，使病不傳，疏肝活血化瘀"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"五付"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6—2碗"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"早餐前及晚餐前各一碗"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1. 禁食維他命及各種人造營養物。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2. 禁食人工甘味食品，多吃有機自然食物。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3. 不要做化療及手術。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4. 要保持心情愉快。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5. 病患停經時曾服女性荷爾蒙減少停經的不適，這是女性得到肺癌的元兇之一。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]}]}]}